# This directory contains log files generated by the application
# Log files are not committed to version control
# 
# Log files are organized by environment and type:
# 
# Development:
#   - django-all.log       - All Django logs (DEBUG and above)
#   - django-error.log     - Error logs only
#   - celery.log          - Celery worker logs
#   - security.log        - Security-related logs
# 
# Test:
#   - django-test.log     - Test environment logs
#   - django-test-error.log - Test errors
# 
# Staging:
#   - django-info.log     - Info level logs (JSON, sampled at 50%)
#   - django-warning.log  - Warning level logs (JSON)
#   - django-error.log    - Error logs (JSON)
#   - celery.log         - Celery worker logs (JSON, sampled)
#   - celery-error.log   - Celery error logs (JSON)
#   - security.log       - Security logs (JSON)
#   - performance.log    - Performance issues (JSON)
# 
# Production:
#   - django-info.log     - Info level logs (sampled at 10%)
#   - django-warning.log  - Warning level logs
#   - django-error.log    - Error logs
#   - celery.log         - Celery worker logs (sampled)
#   - celery-error.log   - Celery error logs
#   - security.log       - Security logs
#   - performance.log    - Performance-related logs
# 
# All log files use rotating file handlers to prevent unlimited growth.

